{
    "background_story": "Chosen was a former soldier who had spent years searching for answers about his past. As a child, he was separated from his family during a brutal war, and the trauma had left him with fragmented memories and a deep sense of loss. Years of therapy and investigation had yielded little progress, leaving Chosen feeling stuck and uncertain. But then, a chance encounter with a former comrade led him to a long-lost relative, who possessed a box of family heirlooms and letters. As Chosen sifted through the contents, the pieces of his past began to fall into place. He finally learned the truth about his family's fate and the circumstances of his separation. The revelation brought a mix of emotions, but ultimately, Chosen felt a sense of closure wash over him. He was finally able to lay the ghosts of his past to rest and start rebuilding his life with a newfound sense of purpose and belonging.",
